    {
      "text": "Except a man be born again, he cannot see the kingdom, John 3:3. we also should walk in newness of life, Rom. 6:4. be ye transformed by the renewing of your mind, Rom. 12:2. if any man be in Christ, he is a new creature, 2 Cor. 5:17. to make in himself of twain one new man, Eph. 2:15. that ye put on the new man, Eph. 4:24 (Col. 3:10). hath begotten us again unto a lively hope, 1 Pet. 1:3. every one that doeth righteousness is born of him, 1 Jn. 2:29. Whosoever is born of God doth not commit sin, 1 Jn. 3:9. every one that loveth is born of God, 1 Jn. 4:7. whosoever is born of God sinneth not, 1 Jn. 5:18.",
