    {
      "text": "thy faith hath made thee whole, Enos 1:8. putteth off the natural man and becometh a saint, Mosiah 3:19. ye will not have a mind to injure one another, Mosiah 4:13. we have no more disposition to do evil, but to do good, Mosiah 5:2. ye are born of him and have become his sons, Mosiah 5:7. all mankind … must be born again; yea, born of God, Mosiah 27:25. have ye spiritually been born of God, Alma 5:14 (5:7–14, 26–28). they must repent and be born again, Alma 5:49 (7:14). their hearts had been changed, Alma 19:33. what shall I do that I may be born of God, Alma 22:15. I had been born of God, Alma 36:23. if I had not been born of God I should not have known, Alma 38:6.",
